# The repository is two projects: the game in `src/` (Godot) and the original browser version in
# `old/` (TypeScript). Each keeps its own ignore file for what its own tools write; this one is
# only what belongs to neither.

# ── Agent and editor working state ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Session data, local settings, memory and scratchpads: how the work was done, not what was made.
.claude/
.cursor/
.aider*
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.swo
*~

# ── Local-only and OS ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.local
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
*.log
